{"about_the_game":"\u2694\ufe0f Revenge of Trasmoz is the second episode of the Trasmoz Legends trilogy, continuing the story right where the first game left off. This time, the action jumps to the powerful 8-bit Amstrad CPC, bringing even more color, intensity, and challenge. Play instantly via Steam with built-in emulation using RetroVirtualMachine: no setup required, just double-click and play.<br> <br> <br>Though the curse on the town has been lifted, Mutamin, the immortal servant of darkness, still lives\u2026 and his revenge is near. Two new heroes must enter the cursed lands once again to fight monstrous creatures, discover new mechanics, and face the final showdown against the sorcerer himself.<br> <br>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f With brand new enemies, expanded gameplay and a vibrant visual style powered by the CPC\u2019s 16-color Mode 0, this entry feels like a generational leap within the same haunted world. *Revenge of Trasmoz* has been praised by the press, earning multiple awards, including Best Game, Best Arcade and Best Soundtrack, at the 2024 Amstrad Eterno Awards.<br> <br> \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong><br> <br>- Classic single-screen arcade platformer with 2-player co-op story mode.<br>- New stages, enemies, and expanded mechanics compared to the first game.<br>- Epic boss battle against the dark sorcerer Mutamin.<br>- Vivid visuals in 16-color Mode 0.<br>- Original soundtrack using the iconic AY-3-8912 chip.<br>- Embedded RetroVirtualMachine: just double-click and play, no setup needed.<br> <br>\ud83c\udfae You're not alone this time. The battle for Trasmoz continues\u2026 and this time, revenge will be legendary.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939540?t=1755102288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939540?t=1755102288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939540/73418078353